    "name": "12 Labours of Hercules XVIII: Ghost Sheep",
    "steam_appid": 3778260,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join Hercules on a time-management adventure!</strong> Gather resources, build and upgrade structures, complete strategic tasks, and banish mischievous ghosts to restore balance to the world. With 56 challenging levels, multiple difficulty modes, and powerful boosts, your hero\u2019s journey through myth and mayhem begins now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778260/extras/82d7e718f9fa54dbdf21e1993f86f86f.avif?t=1753725479\" width=581 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the serene gardens of Hellas, Hercules was enjoying a well-earned moment of rest. But peace never lasts long for a true hero. When Megara asked him to water the wilting trees, Hercules leapt into action\u2026 a little too enthusiastically. The ground cracked, unleashing the waters of the underground river Styx\u2014and drying it up. In an instant, the lands of Hellas were flooded, ancient curses were awakened, and restless spirits began to roam. Even the underworld fell into chaos, and furious Hades rose to confront the destruction of his domain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778260/extras/ac1b1e314f53b77137c70137dfe40cb9.avif?t=1753725479\" width=577 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a thrilling journey across cursed landscapes as you help Hercules and his brave companions repair the damage and face the supernatural forces unleashed. Battle mischievous ghosts, meet gods and mythical creatures, restore sacred waters, and nurture new life to bring fertility back to the land. Each level brings new challenges, clever puzzles, and twists that will test your strategy and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778260/extras/c196ea7430346ed7d34e00fd151b0fd4.avif?t=1753725479\" width=581 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to start a supernatural adventure? Play \u201c12 Labours of Hercules XVIII: Ghost Sheep\u201d\u2014bring light back to a world haunted by shadows!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778260/extras/0790eaab52a9cb56bbe049051e84c901.avif?t=1753725479\" width=581 height=165 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel ancient curses and restore balance to the underworld!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a new Game Speed setting with Hercules by your side!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills with unique obstacles and exciting challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore sublevels, bonus levels, super bonus levels and extra super-bonus levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic journey amidst breathtaking HD visuals!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juggle tasks, battle mischievous ghosts, and be the hero!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778260/extras/b33ee897a41ae04ca7ccfbae874833af.avif?t=1753725479\" width=581 height=165 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join Hercules on a time-management adventure!</strong> Gather resources, build and upgrade structures, complete strategic tasks, and banish mischievous ghosts to restore balance to the world. With 56 challenging levels, multiple difficulty modes, and powerful boosts, your hero\u2019s journey through myth and mayhem begins now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778260/extras/82d7e718f9fa54dbdf21e1993f86f86f.avif?t=1753725479\" width=581 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the serene gardens of Hellas, Hercules was enjoying a well-earned moment of rest. But peace never lasts long for a true hero. When Megara asked him to water the wilting trees, Hercules leapt into action\u2026 a little too enthusiastically. The ground cracked, unleashing the waters of the underground river Styx\u2014and drying it up. In an instant, the lands of Hellas were flooded, ancient curses were awakened, and restless spirits began to roam. Even the underworld fell into chaos, and furious Hades rose to confront the destruction of his domain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778260/extras/ac1b1e314f53b77137c70137dfe40cb9.avif?t=1753725479\" width=577 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a thrilling journey across cursed landscapes as you help Hercules and his brave companions repair the damage and face the supernatural forces unleashed. Battle mischievous ghosts, meet gods and mythical creatures, restore sacred waters, and nurture new life to bring fertility back to the land. Each level brings new challenges, clever puzzles, and twists that will test your strategy and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778260/extras/c196ea7430346ed7d34e00fd151b0fd4.avif?t=1753725479\" width=581 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to start a supernatural adventure? Play \u201c12 Labours of Hercules XVIII: Ghost Sheep\u201d\u2014bring light back to a world haunted by shadows!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778260/extras/0790eaab52a9cb56bbe049051e84c901.avif?t=1753725479\" width=581 height=165 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel ancient curses and restore balance to the underworld!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a new Game Speed setting with Hercules by your side!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills with unique obstacles and exciting challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore sublevels, bonus levels, super bonus levels and extra super-bonus levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic journey amidst breathtaking HD visuals!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juggle tasks, battle mischievous ghosts, and be the hero!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778260/extras/b33ee897a41ae04ca7ccfbae874833af.avif?t=1753725479\" width=581 height=165 /></span></p>",
